{
  "description": "Note title and Markdown → tags (architecture §7.5). Every platform's extractor must produce exactly `tags`, in order: one entry per tag, first spelling kept, duplicates (case-insensitive) dropped. `title` is plain text and is scanned before the body.",
  "cases": [
    { "name": "single word", "markdown": "Buy #groceries today", "tags": ["groceries"] },
    { "name": "start of line", "markdown": "#work stuff", "tags": ["work"] },
    { "name": "several", "markdown": "#a and #b", "tags": ["a", "b"] },
    { "name": "heading marker is not a tag", "markdown": "# Heading\n\n## Sub ##", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "tag inside heading", "markdown": "## Plans #travel", "tags": ["travel"] },
    { "name": "heading closing hashes", "markdown": "## Plans #travel ##", "tags": ["travel"] },
    { "name": "multi word", "markdown": "Ideas for #summer trip# soon", "tags": ["summer trip"] },
    { "name": "multi word at end of line", "markdown": "about #summer trip#", "tags": ["summer trip"] },
    { "name": "multi word before punctuation", "markdown": "(see #summer trip#).", "tags": ["summer trip"] },
    { "name": "closing hash needs text before it", "markdown": "#a b # c", "tags": ["a"] },
    { "name": "closing hash glued to a word is not closing", "markdown": "#a b#c", "tags": ["a"] },
    { "name": "multi word stops at the next hash", "markdown": "#a b #c d#", "tags": ["a", "c d"] },
    { "name": "multi word collapses spaces", "markdown": "#big   idea#", "tags": ["big idea"] },
    { "name": "nested", "markdown": "Fix #home/repairs/roof now", "tags": ["home/repairs/roof"] },
    { "name": "nested multi word", "markdown": "#school projects/biology 101#", "tags": ["school projects/biology 101"] },
    { "name": "nested segments trimmed", "markdown": "#school / biology#", "tags": ["school/biology"] },
    { "name": "empty segments dropped", "markdown": "#a//b/ next", "tags": ["a/b"] },
    { "name": "only slashes is not a tag", "markdown": "#/ and #//", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "trailing punctuation ends the tag", "markdown": "Tags: #one, #two. #three! #four? #five; #six:", "tags": ["one", "two", "three", "four", "five", "six"] },
    { "name": "inner punctuation ends the tag", "markdown": "#v1.2 and #a+b and #x$y", "tags": ["v1", "a", "x"] },
    { "name": "dash and underscore kept", "markdown": "#to-do #snake_case", "tags": ["to-do", "snake_case"] },
    { "name": "inside parentheses", "markdown": "(#aside) [#box] {#brace}", "tags": ["aside", "box", "brace"] },
    { "name": "must follow whitespace", "markdown": "C# and a#b and x/#y", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "hash then space is not a tag", "markdown": "a # b", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "double hash is not a tag", "markdown": "##nope", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "digits only is not a tag", "markdown": "#1 issue and #2024/10", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "digits wrapped are a tag", "markdown": "#2024# review", "tags": ["2024"] },
    { "name": "digits with letters", "markdown": "#2024q1 #3d", "tags": ["2024q1", "3d"] },
    { "name": "case insensitive duplicates keep first spelling", "markdown": "#Work then #work and #WORK", "tags": ["Work"] },
    { "name": "nested duplicates", "markdown": "#Home/Repairs and #home/repairs", "tags": ["Home/Repairs"] },
    { "name": "unicode", "markdown": "#café #日本語 #naïve", "tags": ["café", "日本語", "naïve"] },
    { "name": "emoji", "markdown": "#🐻 and #🐻 bears#", "tags": ["🐻", "🐻 bears"] },
    { "name": "list items", "markdown": "- #one\n- [ ] #two\n1. #three", "tags": ["one", "two", "three"] },
    { "name": "blockquote", "markdown": "> #quoted", "tags": ["quoted"] },
    { "name": "emphasis is transparent", "markdown": "**#bold** and *#italic* and #half**way**", "tags": ["bold", "italic", "halfway"] },
    { "name": "code span is not a tag", "markdown": "Run `#not` but #yes", "tags": ["yes"] },
    { "name": "fenced code is not a tag", "markdown": "```c\n#include <stdio.h>\n```\n#after", "tags": ["after"] },
    { "name": "link text is not a tag", "markdown": "[#notatag](https://x.y) #yes", "tags": ["yes"] },
    { "name": "url fragment is not a tag", "markdown": "https://example.com/#anchor and <https://x.y/#z>", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "image alt is not a tag", "markdown": "![#alt](a.png)", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "escaped hash is still a tag", "markdown": "\\#escaped", "tags": ["escaped"] },
    { "name": "tag stops at end of line", "markdown": "#first line#\n#second", "tags": ["first line", "second"] },
    { "name": "multi word does not span lines", "markdown": "#one\ntwo#", "tags": ["one"] },
    { "name": "title", "title": "Trip #travel", "markdown": "#Travel and #packing", "tags": ["travel", "packing"] },
    { "name": "title is plain text", "title": "**#bold**", "markdown": "", "tags": [] },
    { "name": "crlf", "markdown": "#a\r\n#b", "tags": ["a", "b"] }
  ]
}
